sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula — MorphoEval overall 94.0/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 94.1/100, up from 56.4/100 in v1). The remediated script minimizes the 2D doubly-curved shallow shell elastic energy U(kappa_x, kappa_y) via L-BFGS-B relaxation and integrates the coupled 2D poroelastic + inertial snap dynamics across alpha in [0.2, 5.0]; reproduces the cusp catastrophe threshold alpha_c = 0.8000, saddle-node fold locus (r = 1.0000), and three-stage closure kinematics (tau_snap = 56.0 ms vs poroelastic hydraulic limit tau_p = 2.53 s, r_kx = 1.0000); validates quartic leaf-size scaling and surgical curvature-relief strip cutting ablation (L_eff = L/3 -> alpha = 0.037 < alpha_c, barrier = 0.0); and segments the SHA-256-locked Dionaea muscipula specimen image (bilateral symmetry = 0.9745, 15 marginal cilia teeth). Overall 94.0/100 (faithfulness 93.8, reproducibility 94.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 94, Morphometric validation 95, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py at 8871db0, image/png, 1375264 B, 2682×1653 px, artifact_sha256 d3f5e5d058cf4b04e7250ea4a7c0b223d472b2731048bd90b9ce3fdce46823be (sha256 d3f5e5d058cf4b04e7250ea4a7c0b223d472b2731048bd90b9ce3fdce46823be), spec_fingerprint 09b1066fde1900adefad4e5592cdbc34803c6f1439dd9667ec1014d5137d4133. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 09b1066fde1900adefad4e5592cdbc34803c6f1439dd9667ec1014d5137d4133; artifact_sha256: d3f5e5d058cf4b04e7250ea4a7c0b223d472b2731048bd90b9ce3fdce46823be; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/dionaea_muscipula_trap_lobe_specimen.jpg=f2738290d66e4418..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/paper_citations.bib=f6ac2d52597b043c..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/scout_manifest.json=572531a0986c798e..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling_reference.json=593d9449e870fcf2...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-audit." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the doubly-curved shallow shell snap-buckling dynamics to a spatially resolved finite-element model of trigger hair mechanosensitive ion-channel action potential propagation across the lobe." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.94"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 066 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
